---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<LegalPage title="Privacy Notice" description="How iswar.me collects, uses, and protects personal information.">
	<h2>1. What this notice covers</h2>
	<p>This Privacy Notice explains how iswar.me, operated by Iswar C. Mondal, handles personal information when you visit iswar.me, contact us, or use our products and services.</p>

	<h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Contact details and business information you provide when you enquire, subscribe, or request support.</li>
		<li>Payment and billing details processed by Paddle. We do not store your full payment card number.</li>
		<li>Service information needed to configure and operate an AI receptionist or reputation management service.</li>
		<li>Technical information such as browser, device, approximate location, and pages visited when you use the website.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>3. How we use information</h2>
	<p>We use information to provide and support the services, process payments, communicate with you, improve the website and products, prevent abuse, comply with legal obligations, and respond to questions or requests.</p>

	<h2>4. Service providers</h2>
	<p>We may share information with trusted providers that help us host the website, process payments, provide communications, or deliver product functionality. These providers may process information only to perform services for us and under their own applicable privacy terms. Paddle processes payments as our authorized payment provider and merchant of record where applicable.</p>

	<h2>5. Retention and security</h2>
	<p>We keep information only for as long as needed for the purposes described here, including providing services, resolving disputes, maintaining business records, and meeting legal requirements. We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards, but no online system can be guaranteed completely secure.</p>

	<h2>6. Your choices</h2>
	<p>You may ask to access, correct, or delete personal information, or unsubscribe from non-essential communications, by contacting <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a>. You may also have additional rights under the laws that apply to you.</p>

	<h2>7. Cookies and updates</h2>
	<p>The website may use essential technologies needed to operate it and limited analytics or embedded service functionality where enabled. We will update this notice when our practices or legal obligations change. Questions can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
